FixEnforce2DKokkos also has no init() override, so unlike fix_drag_kokkos.cpp:54-55, fix_dt_reset_kokkos.cpp:53-54 and fix_efield_kokkos.cpp:74-75 it never raises 'Cannot (yet) use respa with Kokkos'. KokkosLMP::respa_check (src/KOKKOS/kokkos.cpp:953-977) only refuses fixes whose execution_space is Device, and its whole body is inside `#ifdef LMP_KOKKOS_GPU`, so in a Serial/OpenMP KOKKOS build (where LMPDeviceType == LMPHostType and execution_space == Host) `run_style respa` with `fix enforce2d/kk` is accepted.
